  "releaseNotes": "RichTextKit 0.6.174\n\nPerformance:\n- TextBlock.Layout allocates less memory on every layout (bidi runs, line\n  breaks, font fallback and unshaped font runs no longer allocate)\n\nChanges:\n- FontFallback.GetFontRuns works out all its runs on the first MoveNext\n  instead of one at a time\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/toptensoftware/RichTextKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
